---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/Breadcrumb.astro';

const breadcrumbs = [
  { label: 'Home', href: '/' },
  { label: 'How to Play' }
];

const howToSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "HowTo",
  "name": "How to Play Krillion Reverse-Trivia Game",
  "description": "An independent guide to reading Krillion prompts, choosing valid less-familiar answers and understanding feedback across official and practice versions.",
  "step": [
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "position": 1,
      "name": "Read the Category Prompt",
      "text": "Inspect the open category prompt (e.g. Roman Emperors, Sovereign Nations, or Oscar Winners) displayed on the submarine console."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "position": 2,
      "name": "Filter Out the First-Thought Consensus",
      "text": "Think beyond your first familiar answer, while keeping every restriction in the prompt in mind."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "position": 3,
      "name": "Submit a Valid Obscure Candidate",
      "text": "Type a verifiable, low-frequency historical, geographical, or scientific fact that qualifies under the prompt criteria."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "position": 4,
      "name": "Review Your Dive",
      "text": "Read the feedback and accepted answers in your edition, then use the result to improve your category recall."
    }
  ]
};
---

<Layout
  title="How to Play Krillion: Rules, Answers & Endless Dive Guide - Krillion.si"
  description="Learn how to read Krillion prompts, choose valid rare answers and understand scoring. An independent guide to official play and third-party practice."
  schema={howToSchema}
>
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 prose prose-invert prose-cyan">
    <div class="not-prose mb-8 space-y-3">
      <Breadcrumb items={breadcrumbs} />
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-950/60 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-400 text-xs font-bold font-mono">
        <span>INDEPENDENT PLAYING GUIDE</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-white leading-tight">
        How to Play Krillion: Rules, Mechanics & Depth Curves
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs sm:text-sm">
        Krillion.si • Updated 21 October 2026 • Independent of krillion.io
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Quick Rules Summary Box -->
    <div class="bg-abyss-card border border-cyan-500/30 rounded-3xl p-6 my-8 not-prose space-y-3 shadow-lg shadow-cyan-950/20">
      <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2 font-mono">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"/><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/></svg>
        <span>Krillion at a Glance (Quick Summary)</span>
      </h3>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-300">
        <li><strong>Core Objective:</strong> Answer category prompts with valid, less-familiar choices to go deeper.</li>
        <li><strong>Scoring:</strong> The official game uses curated answer sets and question-specific rarity methods. Third-party practice editions can score differently.</li>
        <li><strong>Turn Clock:</strong> Follow the timer shown in the game you are playing; do not assume every edition uses the same limit.</li>
        <li><strong>Game Modes:</strong> The official Daily Dive and Unlimited mode are at krillion.io. Krillion.si embeds a separate practice edition from krillion.org.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <h2>Step-by-Step Gameplay Walkthrough</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>
        <strong>Read the Category Prompt:</strong> Each round presents a prompt from history, geography, science, literature, or cinema (e.g. <em>"A sovereign nation located in the Southern Hemisphere"</em>).
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Think Beyond the Obvious:</strong> Consider a less familiar answer, but do not sacrifice accuracy just to sound unusual.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Submit a Valid Answer:</strong> Choose something you can explain and check against the prompt. For the Southern Hemisphere example, confirm the location rather than guessing from a country's reputation.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Review the Evaluation:</strong> Read the accepted answer and score from your edition. The official creator describes rarity methods based on reference data, LLM assistance and manual review, depending on the question.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Compare Like for Like:</strong> Use the game's share option if available. Compare results from the same edition and challenge, not official scores against third-party practice scores.
      </li>
    </ol>

    <h2>How official scoring is determined</h2>
    <p>
      The <a href="https://krillion.io/faq" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">creator's FAQ</a>
      explains that answer sets are assembled from sources such as dictionaries, encyclopedias and other relevant datasets.
      Rarity methods vary by question: some use a familiarity database, while others use LLM assistance and manual review.
      The top Krillion answer is also selected for how satisfying it is to find, not rarity alone.
    </p>
    <p>
      This is not a published table of live player percentages. A separate practice game's score does not reveal
      how many official players chose your answer, and it may use a different accepted-answer list.
    </p>

    <h2>Want another round? Find The Endless Dive</h2>
    <p>
      Krillion’s official Unlimited mode is called <a href="/endless/">The Endless Dive</a>.
      Our guide links to the creator’s version at krillion.io and explains how it differs from the
      third-party practice game embedded on Krillion.si. Questions, scoring and progress can differ between versions.
    </p>

    <!-- Bottom CTA Bar -->
    <div class="mt-12 p-8 rounded-3xl bg-abyss-card border border-cyan-500/30 text-center not-prose space-y-4 shadow-xl">
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-white">Put the Rules Into Practice</h3>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 max-w-md mx-auto">
        Try the embedded daily practice, or compare the official and practice Endless Dive versions.
      </p>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
        <a href="/#game" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-blue-500 text-slate-950 font-black text-xs hover:scale-105 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-cyan-500/20">
          Play Daily Dive Now ⚓
        </a>
        <a href="/endless/" class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-white/5 hover:bg-white/10 text-white font-bold text-xs border border-white/10 transition-all">
          The Endless Dive & Practice
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
